1. Directory Management
cd ~ # Change to the home directory

2. File Handling
Confirm the presence of the manifest file and verify its contents
cat manifest.csv

3. Activate QIIME Environment
conda activate qiime2-amplicon-2024.10

4. QIIME Data Import
Import paired-end sequences into QIIME
qiime tools import
--type 'SampleData[PairedEndSequencesWithQuality]'
--input-path manifest.tsv
--output-path paired-end-demux.qza
--input-format PairedEndFastqManifestPhred33V2

# For single-end sequences
qiime tools import \
  --type 'SampleData[SequencesWithQuality]' \
  --input-path manifest.tsv \
  --output-path single-end-demux.qza \
  --input-format SingleEndFastqManifestPhred33V2

5. Removal of Primers for 16S
For 16S (Paired-end Sequences)
qiime cutadapt trim-paired \
  --i-demultiplexed-sequences paired-end-demux.qza \
  --p-front-f GTGYCAGCMGCCGCGGTAA \
  --p-front-r GGACTACNVGGGTWTCTAAT \
  --p-match-adapter-wildcards \
  --p-discard-untrimmed \
  --o-trimmed-sequences trimmed-seqs-16S.qza \
  --verbose

For 16S (Single-end Sequences)
qiime cutadapt trim-single \
  --i-demultiplexed-sequences single-end-demux.qza \
  --p-front GTGYCAGCMGCCGCGGTAA \
  --p-match-adapter-wildcards \
  --p-discard-untrimmed \
  --o-trimmed-sequences trimmed-seqs-16S.qza \
  --verbosee
Why Remove Primers and Adapters:
Eliminate bias: Unwanted sequences (primers, adapters) can skew results, especially in taxonomic classification.
Improve alignment: Ensures that sequences align correctly to reference databases, Increase accuracy: Cleaner data leads to more reliable downstream analyses, including diversity metrics and functional profiling.

Primer Details: 16S Primers: Forward (GTGYCAGCMGCCGCGGTAA), Reverse (GGACTACNVGGGTWTCTAAT) : Primers are fused with partial TruSeq adapter sequences for Illumina sequencing.
6. Visualize Imported Data
Summarize and visualize the imported data
qiime demux summarize
--i-data trimmed-seqs-16S.qza
--o-visualization trimmed-seqs-16S.qzv

7. Denoise with DADA2
DADA2 denoising for paired-end reads
qiime dada2 denoise-paired
--i-demultiplexed-seqs trimmed-seqs-16S.qza
--p-trunc-len-f 240
--p-trunc-len-r 160
--o-table table240160.qza
--o-representative-sequences rep-seqs240160.qza
--o-denoising-stats denoising-stats240160.qza

View DADA2 denoising stats
qiime metadata tabulate
--m-input-file denoising-stats240160.qza
--o-visualization denoising-stats240160.qzv

8. Assign Taxonomy to 16S Sequences
qiime feature-classifier classify-sklearn
--i-classifier silva-138-99-16S-classifier.qza
--i-reads rep-seqs240160.qza
--o-classification taxonomy.qza

9. Filter for Prokaryotes (Archaea and Bacteria only)
Filter the feature table and representative sequences to retain only prokaryotic sequences
qiime taxa filter-table
--i-table table240160.qza
--i-taxonomy taxonomy.qza
--p-include "d__Bacteria, d__Archaea"
--o-filtered-table prokaryotes-table.qza

qiime taxa filter-seqs
--i-sequences rep-seqs240160.qza
--i-taxonomy taxonomy.qza
--p-include "d__Bacteria, d__Archaea"
--o-filtered-sequences prokaryotes-rep-seqs.qza

10. Exclude Mitochondria and Chloroplasts
Filter out mitochondrial and chloroplast sequences
qiime taxa filter-table
--i-table prokaryotes-table.qza
--i-taxonomy taxonomy.qza
--p-exclude "d__Mitochondria, d__Chloroplast"
--o-filtered-table non-mitochondria-chloroplast-table.qza

qiime taxa filter-seqs
--i-sequences prokaryotes-rep-seqs.qza
--i-taxonomy taxonomy.qza
--p-exclude "d__Mitochondria, d__Chloroplast"
--o-filtered-sequences non-mitochondria-chloroplast-rep-seqs.qza

11. Choose Sampling Depth
Perform core metrics analysis with an appropriate sampling depth based on your data
qiime diversity core-metrics-phylogenetic
--i-phylogeny rooted-tree.qza
--i-table non-mitochondria-chloroplast-table.qza
--p-sampling-depth (choosen depth)
--m-metadata-file metadata.tsv
--output-dir core-metrics-results

12. Generate Feature Table Summary
qiime feature-table summarize
--i-table non-mitochondria-chloroplast-table.qza
--o-visualization non-mitochondria-chloroplast-table-summary.qzv

13. Bar Plot for Taxa
qiime taxa barplot
--i-table non-mitochondria-chloroplast-table.qza
--i-taxonomy taxonomy.qza
--m-metadata-file metadata.tsv
--o-visualization taxa-bar-plots.qzv

